#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_editor
#! frames  300
#! poster  60
#! keys
# the marks of an input file: the pointer on line 2 shows its tooltip; a click after the minus of -15 and a backspace
# fix it (its mark goes); on the empty line 5, "mach n" typed opens the completion popup, tab inserts the key
0   move 330 160
10  move 330 70 20
80  move 221 70 12
96  down
98  up
112 key backspace
150 move 90 115 20
174 down
176 up
190 text  mach n
240 key tab
